      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Screener: Log Retry  (item 7a)\nEvery 15 min: screener_log payloads whose Supabase write failed (screener_log_pending) are replayed through screener_log_upsert, Supabase only, never GHL. The upsert is versioned on decided_ms, so an old replay cannot overwrite a newer row. A replayed row leaves the queue; a failed one stays for the next run and for the daily summary.",
        "color": 5
      }
    }
